# SN1 run script. Verbs: wait <state> [timeout_s] | cmd <inspector verb + args> | sleep <s> | hshot <file> | snap
# cmd shot <file.png> also copies the image into the run's shots/ folder. The run ends after "cmd quit" (harness waits for the exit).
wait menu 300
cmd newgame creative
wait ingame 600
cmd pos
cmd biome
cmd batch
cmd teleport 0 -50 0
sleep 2
wait ingame 120
cmd pos
nearpoll 60 30 20
cmd shot ingame.png
hshot ingame_hidden.png
cmd quit
